# Trained weights written by these notebooks.
#
# Every file under models/ is reproducible by re-running the notebook that
# created it, and the set runs to hundreds of MB (the Keras .keras archives and
# the scratch .npz files dominate). The metrics that the report actually quotes
# live in results/*.json, which IS tracked.
#
# The six original notebooks in the repository root take the opposite view and
# commit their weights under results/models/ - see the note in notebook/README.md.
# To follow that convention here instead, delete this rule.


# Decoded-image caches, if anyone points ass4_newdata.CACHE at this folder.
# The default location is data/cache/, already covered by the root .gitignore.
cache/

# Scratch space used by the smoke test in README.md
_smoketmp/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
